  m_text: 'Attention Pattern:

    Attention is concentrated around work, mistakes
    and other people''s expectations.



    Primary Focus:

    Responsibilities
    and criticism repeatedly return to the client''s active attention.



    Observed
    Effect:

    The client struggles to rest, request support or notice restorative
    experiences.



    Assessment:

    Painful memories appear to reinforce one
    another.

    No active crisis is present, but the pattern is unstable.



    Suggested
    Direction:

    Redistribute attention without altering any memory.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
